<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ko"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="402070045"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1717109883"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="싫어 (Hate)"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="4MINUTE"/><amll:meta key="album" value="ACT.7"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:34.957"><div begin="00:02.955" end="03:32.573"><p begin="00:02.955" end="00:08.247" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">네 눈빛이 말해주고 있어<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你的眼神说明了一切</span></p><p begin="00:08.789" end="00:11.701" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">Liar, liar, liar<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">骗子 不要再欺骗我了</span></p><p begin="00:11.701" end="00:14.935" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">더 날 속이지 마, Oh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">别再骗我了</span></p><p begin="00:15.273" end="00:20.717" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">이젠 더 이상 알고 싶지 않아<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在我不想知道更多了</span></p><p begin="00:21.199" end="00:24.501" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">I don't wanna know, know, know</p><p begin="00:25.127" end="00:30.107" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">더는 No, no, no 다 끝났어<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一切到此为止 就此结束</span></p><p begin="00:31.619" end="00:34.963" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">가요, 가요 여기까진가 봐요<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">走吧 走吧 看来这里就是尽头</span></p><p begin="00:34.963" end="00:38.257" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">Get out, get out 뒤돌아서 나가요<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">走吧 转身走吧</span></p><p begin="00:38.808" end="00:43.443" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">이 사랑의 끝에는 미움만이 남았네요, Oh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在这爱情的最后</span></p><p begin="00:44.610" end="00:48.016" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">끝이 없던 우리 사랑에도 끝이 보여<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在我们漫无止境的爱情里 也看到了尽头</span></p><p begin="00:48.016" end="00:51.312" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">어쭙잖은 이유들로 질질 끌지 마요<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不要用不自然的理由硬撑下去</span></p><p begin="00:51.312" end="00:56.419" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">늦었어 이미 끝났어, Oh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为时已晚 一切都结束了</span></p><p begin="00:57.362" end="01:00.789" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">Go, go, go 차라리 이럴 바엔<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">还不如这样离我而去</span></p><p begin="01:00.789" end="01:04.000" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">Done, done, done 싸우다 지칠 바엔<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">都已结束 争吵 疲惫不堪</span></p><p begin="01:04.000" end="01:07.762" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">Go, go, go 이젠 더 이상 못 참겠어<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">走吧 我再也无法忍受了</span></p><p begin="01:07.762" end="01:09.825" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">날 냅 둬봐 날 냅 둬<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">放开我吧 放开我吧</span></p><p begin="01:09.771" end="01:11.908" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">I Hate you, hey</p><p begin="01:13.027" end="01:15.422" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">No, no</p><p begin="01:15.693" end="01:18.369" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">I don't need you, hey</p><p begin="01:19.292" end="01:21.553" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">No, no</p><p begin="01:22.361" end="01:23.862" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">I Hate you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">讨厌 讨厌 我讨厌你</span></p><p begin="01:22.978" end="01:26.112" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">싫어, 싫어 난 너 싫어</p><p begin="01:26.261" end="01:29.251" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">싫어, 싫어 난 너 싫어<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">讨厌 讨厌 我讨厌你</span></p><p begin="01:28.632" end="01:30.132" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">I don't need you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">讨厌 讨厌 我讨厌你</span></p><p begin="01:29.861" end="01:33.036" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">싫어, 싫어 난 너 싫어<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">讨厌 讨厌 我讨厌你</span></p><p begin="01:32.610" end="01:36.454" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">싫어, 싫어 난 너 싫어<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">讨厌 讨厌 我讨厌你</span></p><p begin="01:35.613" end="01:38.942" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">답이 없는 답안에 답만 죽어라고 써<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无解的题目里 死死追求着答案</span></p><p begin="01:38.974" end="01:41.945" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">사랑의 콩깍지가 아닌 색안경을 껴<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没有溅起爱情火花 反而戴上了有色眼镜</span></p><p begin="01:42.299" end="01:45.294" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">이런 식으로 할 바엔 그냥 헤어지는 게 나았어<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果继续这样下去的话</span></p><p begin="01:45.411" end="01:48.716" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">널 만나서 외롭다면 혼자 외롭고 말겠어<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">还不如分手</span></p><p begin="01:48.716" end="01:49.922" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">I don't wanna know<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你每天一样的辩解</span></p><p begin="01:49.956" end="01:51.736" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">너의 매일 똑같은 변명<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你每天一样的辩解</span></p><p begin="01:52.053" end="01:53.021" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">I don't wanna do<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每天都在无休止地争吵</span></p><p begin="01:53.021" end="01:54.900" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">매일 계속되는 말다툼<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每天都在反复争吵</span></p><p begin="01:55.165" end="02:00.322" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">의미 없어 지겨워졌어, Oh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">毫无意义 变得厌倦</span></p><p begin="02:00.814" end="02:06.443" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">이제 와 우린 더는 답이 없잖아<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在我们已经没有答案了 不是吗</span></p><p begin="02:06.443" end="02:08.258" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">나는 이제 싫어 Hate you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我现在讨厌你</span></p><p begin="02:11.204" end="02:13.335" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">이제 난 네가 싫어졌어<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我现在渐渐变得讨厌你</span></p><p begin="02:13.514" end="02:15.837" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">I Hate you, hey</p><p begin="02:16.735" end="02:19.328" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">No, no</p><p begin="02:19.973" end="02:22.608" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">I don't need you, hey</p><p begin="02:23.069" end="02:25.742" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">No, no</p><p begin="02:26.345" end="02:27.776" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">I Hate you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">讨厌 讨厌 我讨厌你</span></p><p begin="02:27.153" end="02:29.988" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">싫어, 싫어 난 너 싫어<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">讨厌 讨厌 我讨厌你</span></p><p begin="02:30.337" end="02:33.340" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">싫어, 싫어 난 너 싫어<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">讨厌 讨厌 我讨厌你</span></p><p begin="02:32.155" end="02:34.157" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46">I don't need you</p><p begin="02:33.685" end="02:36.539" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47">싫어, 싫어 난 너 싫어<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">讨厌 讨厌 我讨厌你</span></p><p begin="02:36.734" end="02:39.670" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L48">싫어, 싫어 난 너 싫어<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">讨厌 讨厌 我讨厌你</span></p><p begin="02:39.812" end="02:41.311" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L49">가요, 가요<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">走吧 走吧</span></p><p begin="02:43.013" end="02:44.484" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L50">Get out, get out</p><p begin="02:46.249" end="02:47.719" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L51">가요, 가요<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">走吧 走吧</span></p><p begin="02:49.634" end="02:51.036" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L52">Get out, get out</p><p begin="02:52.727" end="02:55.632" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L53">미친 듯이 우리 둘은 사랑을 했고<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们疯狂地相爱过</span></p><p begin="02:55.759" end="02:58.919" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L54">난 미친 듯이 바보처럼 끌려다녔어<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我像疯了一般 像个傻瓜一般 被牵着鼻子走</span></p><p begin="02:58.900" end="03:04.168" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L55">너무했어 그럴법했어 넌<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">太过分了 曾这样对我的你</span></p><p begin="03:06.358" end="03:08.724" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L56">I Hate you, hey</p><p begin="03:10.013" end="03:11.973" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L57">No, no</p><p begin="03:12.657" end="03:15.736" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L58">I don't need you, hey</p><p begin="03:16.409" end="03:18.340" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L59">No, no</p><p begin="03:19.233" end="03:20.439" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L60">I Hate you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">讨厌 讨厌 我讨厌你</span></p><p begin="03:20.038" end="03:22.814" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L61">싫어, 싫어 난 너 싫어</p><p begin="03:23.115" end="03:26.219" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L62">싫어, 싫어 난 너 싫어<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">讨厌 讨厌 我讨厌你</span></p><p begin="03:25.642" end="03:26.944" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L63">I don't need you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">讨厌 讨厌 我讨厌你</span></p><p begin="03:26.391" end="03:29.117" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L64">싫어, 싫어 난 너 싫어<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">讨厌 讨厌 我讨厌你</span></p><p begin="03:29.345" end="03:32.573" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L65">싫어, 싫어 난 너 싫어<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">讨厌 讨厌 我讨厌你</span></p></div></body></tt>